---
import type { SiteLocale } from "@tgbox/shared";
import JsonLd from "@/components/layout/JsonLd.astro";
import { localizePath } from "@/i18n/locale.ts";
import { ui } from "@/i18n/ui.ts";
import { seoUi } from "@/i18n/ui-seo.ts";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { faqJsonLd } from "@/lib/json-ld.ts";
import { aboutSeo } from "@/lib/seo.ts";
import { awesomeUrl, botUrl, botUsername, licence, repoUrl } from "@/lib/site.ts";

interface Props {
  locale: SiteLocale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale !== "en";
const bot = `@${botUsername}`;
const seo = aboutSeo(locale);
const { faq, faqHeading } = seoUi(locale);
// PageLayout's breadcrumb nav emits its own BreadcrumbList. Google retired FAQ rich results in
// 2026, but the markup still helps answer engines parse the page.
const jsonLd = [faqJsonLd(faq)];
---

<PageLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={ui(locale).page.about}
  metaTitle={seo.title}
  metaDescription={seo.description}
  keywords={seo.keywords}
  eyebrow="About"
  updated="2026-09-17"
  description={zh
      ? "TGbox是一个支持简体中文、繁体中文和英文的 Telegram 频道、群组和机器人导航站，数据自动更新，失效条目自动下架。"
      : "TGbox is a directory of Telegram channels, groups and bots in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English, with automatically refreshed data and dead entries removed on their own."}
>
  <JsonLd slot="head" data={jsonLd} />
  {zh ? (
      <>
        <p>Telegram 上有大量优质的公开频道、群组和机器人，但自带的搜索很弱，中文用户很难发现好内容。很多导航站内容单薄、数据长期不更新，收录的频道早已被封或停更，页面却还挂着。TGbox想把这件事做得更好。</p>

        <h2>我们做什么</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>信息充实</strong>：每个条目都有头像、简介、分类、标签、语言、精确成员数、创建时间、收录时间和活跃度，频道还能预览最近 20 条消息。</li>
          <li><strong>数据新鲜</strong>：系统定时从 Telegram 公开页面刷新资料，自动识别被封、不存在、转私有的条目并下架，你不会在这里浪费时间。</li>
          <li><strong>提交简单</strong>：频道主在 Telegram 里私聊 <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> 发送链接即可提交，审核结果会私信通知。详见<a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>提交收录说明</a>。</li>
          <li><strong>三种语言</strong>：每个页面都有简体中文、繁体中文和英文版本，可以随时在右上角切换。</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>推广标记</h2>
        <p>部分条目可能是付费或合作展示，这些条目会明确标注“推广”，与普通条目区分开，不会混在自然排序里误导你。</p>

        <h2>快速、轻量</h2>
        <p>整个网站是预先生成的静态页面，不需要登录、不跟踪个人身份，在弱网和手机上也能快速打开。你还可以把网站添加到手机主屏幕，像 App 一样使用。</p>

        <h2>关于本项目</h2>
        <p>TGbox 是一个开源项目：站点、收录机器人和后台的全部代码都在 GitHub 上公开，以 <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> 许可证发布。欢迎在 <a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{repoUrl}</a> 提 issue、发 PR，或者按许可证自建一份属于你自己的导航站。</p>
        <p>整个目录还以 Awesome 列表的形式同步到 GitHub：<a href={awesomeUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">awesome-telegram</a>，每天自动更新，也提供 JSON 数据，方便收藏和引用。</p>

        <h2>联系我们</h2>
        <p>发现失效条目、错误分类、违规内容，或者希望删除自己的条目，请私聊 <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> 并发送 <code>/help</code> 获取联系方式。</p>

        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (
          <>
            <h3>{item.question}</h3>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </>
        ))}
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p>Telegram is full of great public channels, groups and bots, but its built-in search is weak and good content is hard to discover. Many directories are thin, rarely updated, and keep listing channels that were banned or abandoned long ago. TGbox aims to do better.</p>

        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rich pages</strong>: every entry shows its avatar, description, category, tags, language, exact member count, creation date, listing date and activity level. Channels also preview their latest 20 posts.</li>
          <li><strong>Fresh data</strong>: details are refreshed from public Telegram pages on a schedule. Banned, deleted or privatised entries are detected and taken down automatically.</li>
          <li><strong>Easy submissions</strong>: owners message <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> with a link and get the review result by private message. See the <a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>submission guide</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Three languages</strong>: every page exists in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English; switch any time from the header.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Promoted entries</h2>
        <p>Some entries may be paid or partner placements. They are always clearly marked “Promoted” so they are never confused with regular listings.</p>

        <h2>Fast and light</h2>
        <p>The whole site is pre-built static pages: no sign-in, no personal tracking, and quick to load on slow networks and phones. You can also add it to your home screen and use it like an app.</p>

        <h2>About this project</h2>
        <p>TGbox is open source: the site, the submission bot and the admin all live in one public repository, released under the <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> licence. File an issue or a pull request at <a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{repoUrl}</a>, or run your own directory from the same code under the terms of that licence.</p>
        <p>The whole directory is also mirrored to GitHub as an awesome list, <a href={awesomeUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">awesome-telegram</a>, regenerated daily with a JSON copy of the data for anyone who wants to star, fork or cite it.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>To report a dead entry, a wrong category or abusive content, or to have your own entry removed, message <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> and send <code>/help</code> for contact details.</p>

        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (
          <>
            <h3>{item.question}</h3>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </>
        ))}
      </>
    )}
</PageLayout>
